dgCompHIT.rea
-3                     spatial dimension  ( < 0 --> generate .rea/.re2 pair)
1                      number of fields
#=======================================================================
#
#    compHIT box: 32^3 elements on [0,1]^3, fully periodic.
#    dgCompHIT.udf rescales the mesh to [0,L]^3 (CompNek5000 usrdat2).
#
#    Note that the character bcs _must_ have 3 spaces.
#
#=======================================================================
#
Box
-32  -32  -32                                        nelx,nely,nelz for Box
0 1 1.                                               x0,x1,gain  (rescaled in udf)
0 1 1.                                               y0,y1,gain  (rescaled in udf)
0 1 1.                                               z0,z1,gain  (rescaled in udf)
P  ,P  ,P  ,P  ,P  ,P                                bc's  (3 chars each!)
